You chant the destruction of Mal'Rok, the demon's homeworld.

Each time you kill a creature you send out a magical ripple in radius [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] that applies a bane of blindness or confusion for [2, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

Baned creatures also suffer [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage per turn.

Damage increases with your spellpower.
